@ajambrosino Before fixing every app on Earth, can we get two OpenAI apps to hand work to each other?

My dot can coordinate ChatGPT threads, but I still have to manually shuttle ZIP files and prompts into Codex.

Somehow, I'm the integration layer.

note_tweet.text:
@thsottiaux - It's been delightful using my Dot to help me navigate complex travel arrangements internationally. Amazing stuff. 

Then, I land in EU to move on the next leg of my journey and my Dot has gone completely MIA - literally vanished from the menu on mobile.

This is a really poor experience and something you should address.  If the account is based in a place where Dots are "allowed" and the person has an established Dot, rug pulling them based on a new temporary location doesn't make any sense.

